<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-17T05:09:33.978Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 05:09:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese Armed Forces have captured Al-Khuwai and five other locations in West Kordofan and are moving toward Al-Nahud while sending reinforcements to the Blue Nile front, increasing pressure on the Rapid Support Forces. The RSF continues drone attacks on civilian populations and power stations, causing darkness and civilian casualties, including children. A Rapid Support Forces field commander defected to the SAF and a former RSF adviser was released in Chad, while a former Sudanese information minister was attacked in Uganda. Former Sudanese official wanted by the ICC was arrested, confirming U.S. involvement. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;upi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Tribune-Democrat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE1pMGRNU3ZLUFVuMDU4RXRPUUlhNzhtUUoxUE1mQTJSMENIeGl4RjcxeVJfSGZoX2FrSVNZM1RJbW4wUHowaV9VQ29vUUU0UF9kVWZKSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yemen Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5rX2JkTXZ5emdiV2RyWVhuZk54OWd2Yk90dm4tS1pKTE5UUnJIWDFlajV4emZhYVNzbUw2amVvaG9TZWRwNUhEbEl0UXNWXzBS?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFBzekFxLUxibkFVc3hPSFhZVHdkczllRXNHeWJoT2MwVGpmVGIzaEVrdFQxOGdZeVp6UzZ6SXRETFpYd210Wko5REprR2gtMnFv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFBzR29nNkRnMTlOWnFaa0d